---
import "remixicon/fonts/remixicon.css";
---

<section
    id="whats-next-section"
    class="full-page-section pt-24 px-3 bg-white dark:bg-dark-bg-elevated border-y border-gray-100 dark:border-dark-border"
>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-10">
        <div>
            <p
                class="uppercase tracking-wider text-sm text-brand-primary font-medium"
            >
                Career Goals
            </p>
            <h2 class="heading-2">What's Next?</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-lead text-left max-w-2xl">
            I am looking for an opportunity in the
            <span class="text-brand-primary font-medium"
                >machine learning space</span
            > - mentorship, a full-time role, hopefully both!
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-left max-w-2xl">
            <p class="text-body mb-2">
                I have a strong foundation in engineering and delivering
                applications, coupled with a keen intuition for data quality—a
                critical input for AI systems today. For the past 3 years, I've
                been deeply focused on studying and applying large language
                models, text embeddings, and tool-enabled agents.
            </p>

            <p class="text-body">
                My goal is to step into a <strong
                    >Machine Learning Engineer</strong
                > role where I can curate data, run rigorous experiments, and push
                impactful results to production. I believe that diving deep into
                data and experimentation will round out my engineering toolkit and
                keep me engaged in the workplace.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
